[h1]巨作一键整理[/h1]
[b]0.3.0-mp.2 · 支持单机与联机（联机测试版）[/b]

联机玩家请使用相同版本。

巨作一多，不用再挨个试着换。点击一次，优先组合主题，再整理其余藏品，保留已有主题。

[h2]实机演示[/h2]
本局同一批 24 件藏品，经过三次自动交换，主题由 1 座变为 5 座。

[url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MuCYF0KRlxY]观看 28 秒实机演示：手动整理 → 一键整理 → 前后对照[/url]

[b]整理前：24 件藏品，1 座主题[/b]
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/15973565912418897780/68D46C2B07E73A11AEEE12DFDB1374F65ED28585/[/img]

[b]整理后：24 件藏品，5 座主题[/b]
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/12587508650331370669/49F7148F785DEA7750400297666C85196E613557/[/img]

[h2]功能[/h2]
[list]
[*]读取整个巨作面板，整理艺术品、文物、遗物、著作、音乐及公司产品。
[*]按实际作品和合法槽位规划，包含奇观、宗教建筑、混合与额外槽位。
[*]优先组合新主题，再改善其余藏品的存放；保留已有主题。
[*]使用游戏原生移动指令逐笔交换，窗口中显示当前主题数量与整理状态。
[/list]

[h2]安装与使用[/h2]
点击订阅，等待 Steam 下载完成，在“额外内容 → 模组”中启用“巨作一键整理 / Auto Theme”。进入自己的回合，打开巨作窗口，点击“一键整理”，等待完成。需要中止时点击停止或关闭窗口。

[h2]游戏与模组[/h2]
巨作主题化是《文明 VI》本体已有机制，并非《风云变幻》或《和而不同》特有功能。AutoTheme 不依赖《和而不同》，按当前游戏的作品、建筑与槽位规则整理，也可与《和而不同》搭配使用。

[h2]源码与共同开发[/h2]
[url=https://github.com/civs6-mods/AutoTheme]GitHub 源码、问题反馈与 Pull Request[/url]
欢迎参与翻译、测试与 Lua / UI 开发。反馈时请提供游戏版本、DLC、启用模组、复现步骤及相关日志。

[hr][/hr]

[h1]Auto Theme[/h1]
[b]0.3.0-mp.2 · Single-player and multiplayer (multiplayer beta)[/b]

All players should use the same mod version for multiplayer.

Too many Great Works to rearrange by hand? Click once to form new themes first, then organize the remaining collection while preserving existing themes.

[h2]Gameplay demo[/h2]
In this game, the same 24 Great Works went from one themed building to five in three automatic swaps.

[url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MuCYF0KRlxY]Watch the 28-second gameplay demo: manual rearrangement, one click, before and after[/url]

[b]Before: 24 Great Works, one themed building[/b]
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/15973565912418897780/68D46C2B07E73A11AEEE12DFDB1374F65ED28585/[/img]

[b]After: 24 Great Works, five themed buildings[/b]
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/12587508650331370669/49F7148F785DEA7750400297666C85196E613557/[/img]

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Organizes art, artifacts, relics, writing, music and corporation products across the Great Works panel.
[*]Plans around actual works and legal slots, including wonders, religious buildings, mixed slots and additional slots.
[*]Forms new themes first, improves remaining placements and preserves existing themes.
[*]Performs native move requests one at a time, with themed-building count and progress shown in the toolbar.
[/list]

[h2]Installation and use[/h2]
Subscribe, wait for the download, and enable Auto Theme in Additional Content → Mods. During your turn, open Great Works and click Arrange Great Works. Click Stop or close the window to stop arranging.

[h2]Game and mods[/h2]
Great Work theming is part of base Civilization VI. AutoTheme does not require Harmony in Diversity; it uses the works, buildings and slot rules in the current game and can also be used alongside HD.

[h2]Source and contributions[/h2]
[url=https://github.com/civs6-mods/AutoTheme]GitHub source code, issues and pull requests[/url]
Translations, tests and Lua / UI contributions are welcome. For bug reports, include game version, DLC, enabled mods, reproduction steps and relevant logs.
